OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering showers easing off with some
OL,7,Flate evening sunshine possible. Mostly
OL,8,Fdry overnight with a few clear spells,
OL,9,Fperhaps breezy along coasts. A mild
OL,10,Fnight for most.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FDry to start, perhaps with
OL,13,Fsome early sunny spells mainly for
OL,14,Feastern areas. Cloud thickening, with
OL,15,Frain arriving from late morning, this
OL,16,Foccasionally heavy and persisting into
OL,17,Fthe evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
